---
title: Validation and error handling
---
classDiagram
	class Endpoint
	class ValidationBehavior
	class Validator
	class ValidationException
	class ValidationExceptionHandler
	class GlobalExceptionHandler
	class ProblemDetails

	Endpoint --> ValidationBehavior: dispatches request
	ValidationBehavior --> Validator: runs applicable validators
	ValidationBehavior ..> ValidationException: throws for invalid input
	ValidationExceptionHandler ..> ValidationException: translates
	ValidationExceptionHandler --> ProblemDetails: 400 field errors
	GlobalExceptionHandler --> ProblemDetails: maps 400, 409, or 500
